WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.828 --> 00:00:11.606
Each teaching week's activity opens on its own page: the experiment first, then the simulation, then the workbench where you practise the idea.

2
00:00:11.606 --> 00:00:16.477
The weekly experience is where you work an idea between classes.

3
00:00:16.477 --> 00:00:21.350
Move through it at your own pace, then answer in your own words.

4
00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:26.779
Finish by generating your weekly notes to keep a record of your thinking.
